|------|--------|-----------|--------|--------|
| 0 | `null` | `1` | — | Start |
| 1 | `null` | `1` | `2` | Save next; set `1.next = null` |
| 2 | `1` | `2` | `3` | Save next; set `2.next = 1` |
| 3 | `2` | `3` | `null` | Save next; set `3.next = 2` |
| 4 | `3` | `null` | — | Loop ends; return `prev` (node `3`) |

**Result:** `3 → 2 → 1 → null`

